OL,3,GNEWSABoy, 13, seriously injured in
OL,4,Aseafront stabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 13-year-old boy has been seriously
OL,7,Finjured in a stabbing in East Sussex.
OL,9,FEmergency services were called to Grand
OL,10,FParade in Eastbourne, close to the
OL,11,Fjunctions of Elms Avenue and Cavendish
OL,12,FPlace, at about 17:10 BST on Saturday.
OL,14,FA 13-year-old boy was airlifted to
OL,15,Fhospital for treatment, Sussex Police
OL,16,Fsaid.
OL,18,F"A group of young people were seen
OL,19,Fleaving the scene, and work is ongoing
OL,20,Fto locate them," the force added.
